# Raw competition data is NOT published.
# The PDF requires "all code and data dictionaries" in the public repository, not the
# dataset, and forbids sharing data outside the team. The KYC file also contains full
# (synthetic) PAN and Aadhaar values. Evaluators place the organisers' bundle here;
# see data/raw/README.md.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md
Dataset/

# data/processed/ IS committed: Streamlit Community Cloud does not run the pipeline,
# so the deployed app needs the built, privacy-safe Parquet present in the repository.
# Rebuild locally with: python scripts/run_pipeline.py && python scripts/build_analytics.py
outputs/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
nohup.out

